    "system": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "30 days. One prompt per day. A process that actually works.",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This is not a journal you write in when you feel inspired. It is a structured 30-day system. One prompt per day, sequenced intentionally. The first week is about processing. The second is about pattern recognition. The third is about rebuilding. The fourth is about becoming.</p><p>Each prompt takes 10 to 20 minutes. That is all. But done consistently, the cumulative effect is the shift you have been trying to create with willpower alone.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "container_type": "container",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 40,
        "mobile_padding_top": 30,
        "mobile_padding_bottom": 30
      }
    },
    "accountability": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>This journal comes with a commitment.</p>",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you open your Breakup Recovery Journal, you will find a contract. You sign it. You name an accountability partner \u2014 someone who knows you are doing this work and will check in with you.</p><p>No other journal does this at the product level. Because real transformation requires real commitment. Not motivation. Commitment.</p>",
            "nav_check_list": false
          }
        }
      },
